{"id":"f7960174147254b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive3 Analytic Code","display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Analytic Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Analytic Code","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Analytic Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0bde46949efca63c\" href=\"?note=0bde46949efca63c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},c,A,\\mathcal B_\\times,\\operatorname{EvalBor}\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},c,A,\\mathcal B_\\times,\\operatorname{EvalBor}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3AnalyticCode}_S \\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3AnalyticCode}_S \\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3AnalyticCode}_S(X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},c,A,\\mathcal B_\\times,\\operatorname{EvalBor})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal B_\\times=\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times\\omega^\\omega):\n\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S(c,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\mathcal B_\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{EvalBor},\\{c\\},\\mathcal B_\\times)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{EvalBor}(c)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3AnalyticCode}_S(X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},c,A,\\mathcal B_\\times,\\operatorname{EvalBor})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal B_\\times=\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times\\omega^\\omega):\n\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S(c,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\mathcal B_\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{EvalBor},\\{c\\},\\mathcal B_\\times)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{EvalBor}(c)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span> and the code-evaluation map are explicit data; the latter is required to return the Borel set represented by the supplied code implementation.</li>\n<li>An analytic code consists of a Borel code on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times\\omega^\\omega\">\\(X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> together with the first-coordinate projection of its evaluation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"0bde46949efca63c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},c,A,\\mathcal B_\\times,\\operatorname{EvalBor}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3AnalyticCode}_S \\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3AnalyticCode}_S(X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},c,A,\\mathcal B_\\times,\\operatorname{EvalBor})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal B_\\times=\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times\\omega^\\omega):\n\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S(c,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\mathcal B_\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{EvalBor},\\{c\\},\\mathcal B_\\times)\\\\\n&\\land A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{EvalBor}(c)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal N}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times\\omega^\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1820","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive3-analytic-code]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["0bde46949efca63c","9375de7089953a2b","36d7463d215be751"]}